"{\n  \"AND\": {\n    \"left\": {\n      \"AND\": {\n        \"left\": {\n          \"AND\": {\n            \"left\": {\n              \"AND\": {\n                \"left\": {\n                  \"OR\": {\n                    \"left\": {\n                      \"raw_text\": \"Have a major systemic disease\"\n                    },\n                    \"right\": {\n                      \"raw_text\": \"such as chronic kidney disease, chronic liver disease, or chronic heart disease.\"\n                    }\n                  }\n                },\n                \"right\": {\n                  \"OR\": {\n                    \"left\": {\n                      \"raw_text\": \"Are a pregnant woman with infection of human immunodeficiency virus (HIV) or hepatitis C virus (HCV)\"\n                    },\n                    \"right\": {\n                      \"raw_text\": \"or have received treatment for HIV or HCV within the past 6 months.\"\n                    }\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            },\n            \"right\": {\n              \"OR\": {\n                \"left\": {\n                  \"raw_text\": \"Are a pregnant woman receiving any drug with antiviral activity or any form of drug therapy for hepatitis B virus (HBV)\"\n                },\n                \"right\": {\n                  \"raw_text\": \"or have received treatment for HBV within the past 6 months.\"\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        \"right\": {\n          \"AND\": {\n            \"left\": {\n              \"raw_text\": \"Are a pregnant woman whose ultrasonographic examination reveals congenital anomaly of the fetus\"\n            },\n            \"right\": {\n              \"raw_text\": \"or have a history of congenital anomaly of the fetus.\"\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    \"right\": {\n      \"AND\": {\n        \"left\": {\n          \"raw_text\": \"Are a pregnant woman whose amniocentesis reveals any genetic abnormality\"\n        },\n        \"right\": {\n          \"raw_text\": \"or have a history of genetic abnormality.\"\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}"